+# Complete local Core/2 escrow fixture custody
+
+The 43 payloads and `FREEZE.sha256` are exact byte copies of the independent `composition-escrow-complete-independent-oracles` packet. Its freeze SHA256 is `2fd5c05c3a25af78a8f71ab74056f9c6a4342ab42f303a3a0090c360cb6e5f22`. This placement README is new and outside FREEZE; no frozen member was renamed, reformatted or regenerated. The original partial packet, including its freeze, remains unchanged under `original-partial/`.
+
+Retain the precise exposure account in `DERIVATION.md`, `PROVENANCE.json` and `FIELD-PREMISES.json`: post-adoption public DTO/normative exposure included an incidental residual helper and InputDecl-to-StageBinder conversion. Do not call the packet blinded, preimplementation or wholly implementation-unexposed. No product output or proposed consumer selected its expected values.
+
+The consumer compares the whole public Program/filled Plan, three complete library outcome reports, and three complete real CLI reports with exact public ASCII stdout, exit0 and empty stderr. Actual continuations alone feed subsequent resume inputs. Library pretty serialization has no selected byte contract here and is not compared with CLI bytes. Frozen UNRUN statuses describe packet creation; later results must be recorded separately.
+
+All fourteen staged gaps and every original U0–U7/M1–M17/MC/SP/G, financial/composition/private/recursive/native/target/proof/ledger/release exit retain their original dispositions. This finite local sequential trajectory makes no authentication, consumption, replay, conservation or other security judgment. No consumer ran while preparing this source copy.
