+`escrow.mori` is an exact copy of `examples/core/continuations/escrow.mori`. The other three files exactly copy `delivery-scenario.json`, `delivery-false-resume.json` and `delivery-true-resume-complete.json`. The original action is deliver(amount:UInt); its five source statements are Transfer alice→escrow, Liability release/escrow→bob, Await delivery(ready:Bool), Transfer escrow→bob and Discharge release. PAY is exactly `(local,continuation-escrow-oracle,PAY,scale0)`. Marker is declared UInt77 and supplied UInt77; amount is UInt10.
